Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:01:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: coalesce AVARESPONSE bursts for batch Schnorr signature
 verification

Original-Commit: b12f2d8eded902f9b57113a9ad94fcf193f6cfc2
Original-Patch: ecash/047
Split-Concern: whole

Historical compilation prerequisites are tracked separately in daemon/patch-audit;
this provenance-preserving split does not imply standalone build validation.

Stack-Repair-Plan-v2: Process every coalesced response individually when no peer key is available. A malformed response is rejected individually while valid prefix/suffix responses continue. Preserve existing signature verification and bounded coalescing.
